@startuml KRaft State Machine
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title KRaft 状态机转换图

state "UnattachedState" as UNATTACHED #F5F5DC {
    UNATTACHED : **未连接状态**
    UNATTACHED : - 初始状态或失去连接
    UNATTACHED : - 不知道当前Leader
    UNATTACHED : - 等待选举超时
    UNATTACHED : --
    UNATTACHED : **代码位置**:
    UNATTACHED : raft/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/raft/UnattachedState.java
}

state "ProspectiveState" as PROSPECTIVE #F5F5DC {
    PROSPECTIVE : **预候选状态**
    PROSPECTIVE : - PreVote阶段
    PROSPECTIVE : - 测试是否有机会成为候选者
    PROSPECTIVE : - 避免不必要的选举
    PROSPECTIVE : --
    PROSPECTIVE : **代码位置**:
    PROSPECTIVE : raft/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/raft/ProspectiveState.java
}

state "CandidateState" as CANDIDATE #F5F5DC {
    CANDIDATE : **候选者状态**
    CANDIDATE : - 正式选举阶段
    CANDIDATE : - 向其他节点请求投票
    CANDIDATE : - epoch + 1
    CANDIDATE : --
    CANDIDATE : **代码位置**:
    CANDIDATE : raft/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/raft/CandidateState.java
}

state "LeaderState" as LEADER #F5F5DC {
    LEADER : **领导者状态**
    LEADER : - 处理客户端请求
    LEADER : - 复制日志到Followers
    LEADER : - 管理高水位标记
    LEADER : - 发送心跳
    LEADER : --
    LEADER : **代码位置**:
    LEADER : raft/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/raft/LeaderState.java
}

state "FollowerState" as FOLLOWER #F5F5DC {
    FOLLOWER : **跟随者状态**
    FOLLOWER : - 从Leader拉取日志
    FOLLOWER : - 响应投票请求
    FOLLOWER : - 检测Leader失效
    FOLLOWER : --
    FOLLOWER : **代码位置**:
    FOLLOWER : raft/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/raft/FollowerState.java
}

state "ResignedState" as RESIGNED #F5F5DC {
    RESIGNED : **辞职状态**
    RESIGNED : - Leader主动辞职
    RESIGNED : - 发送EndQuorumEpoch
    RESIGNED : - 临时状态
    RESIGNED : --
    RESIGNED : **代码位置**:
    RESIGNED : raft/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/raft/ResignedState.java
}

[*] --> UNATTACHED : 启动

UNATTACHED --> PROSPECTIVE : 选举超时\n(hasElectionTimeoutExpired)
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 选举超时
  - 没有已知Leader
  
  **代码**:
  QuorumState.transitionToProspective()
end note

UNATTACHED --> FOLLOWER : 收到有效Leader的消息
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 收到BeginQuorumEpoch
  - 收到有效的Fetch响应
  
  **代码**:
  QuorumState.transitionToFollower()
end note

PROSPECTIVE --> CANDIDATE : 获得足够PreVote
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 获得多数派PreVote
  - epochElection.isVoteGranted()
  
  **代码**:
  QuorumState.transitionToCandidate()
end note

PROSPECTIVE --> UNATTACHED : PreVote被拒绝或超时
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - PreVote失败
  - 选举超时
  
  **代码**:
  prospectiveTransitionAfterElectionLoss()
end note

PROSPECTIVE --> FOLLOWER : 发现更高epoch的Leader
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 收到更高epoch的消息
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToFollower()
end note

CANDIDATE --> LEADER : 获得多数派投票
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 获得多数派投票
  - epochElection.isVoteGranted()
  
  **代码**:
  QuorumState.transitionToLeader()
  onBecomeLeader()
end note

CANDIDATE --> PROSPECTIVE : 选举失败
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 选举超时
  - 投票被拒绝
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToProspective()
end note

CANDIDATE --> FOLLOWER : 发现更高epoch的Leader
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 收到更高epoch的BeginQuorumEpoch
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToFollower()
end note

LEADER --> RESIGNED : 主动辞职
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 收到shutdown信号
  - 检测到仲裁失效
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToResigned()
end note

LEADER --> UNATTACHED : 失去多数派支持
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - checkQuorum超时
  - 网络分区
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToUnattached()
end note

FOLLOWER --> PROSPECTIVE : Leader失效
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - Fetch超时
  - hasFetchTimeoutExpired()
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToProspective()
end note

FOLLOWER --> FOLLOWER : 收到新Leader的BeginQuorumEpoch
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - 同一epoch内Leader变更
  - 更高epoch的新Leader
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToFollower()
end note

RESIGNED --> UNATTACHED : 辞职完成
note on link
  **触发条件**:
  - EndQuorumEpoch发送完成
  
  **代码**:
  transitionToUnattached()
end note

note top of UNATTACHED
  **状态持久化**:
  所有状态转换都会调用
  QuorumState.durableTransitionTo()
  写入选举状态到磁盘
  
  **文件位置**:
  FileQuorumStateStore.DEFAULT_FILE_NAME
  (__cluster_metadata-0/quorum-state)
end note

note bottom of LEADER
  **Leader特殊职责**:
  1. 管理BatchAccumulator
  2. 处理客户端写请求
  3. 复制日志到Followers
  4. 计算和更新高水位
  5. 发送心跳(空的Fetch响应)
  6. 处理快照传输
end note

note bottom of FOLLOWER
  **Follower特殊职责**:
  1. 定期发送Fetch请求
  2. 应用Leader的日志条目
  3. 更新本地高水位
  4. 响应投票请求
  5. 检测Leader失效
  6. 下载和应用快照
end note

@enduml
